/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 24 0 R
/T (Note: Ensure the wooden surface is properly sanded and free from dust, oil, grease, or other contaminants before application. Woodello NC Sanding Sealer should be applied as the base coat to seal the wood pores and improve adhesion of the top coat. Allow proper drying and light sanding before applying Woodello NC Lacquer. Always stir well before use and dilute only with Woodello NC Thinner as recommended. Avoid excessive thinning and ensure containers are tightly closed after use to prevent solvent evaporation and contamination.)
/E (Note: Ensure the wooden surface is properly sanded and free from dust, oil, grease, or other contaminants before application. Woodello NC Sanding Sealer should be applied as the base coat to seal the wood pores and improve adhesion of the top coat. Allow proper drying and light sanding before applying Woodello NC Lacquer. Always stir well before use and dilute only with Woodello NC Thinner as recommended. Avoid excessive thinning and ensure containers are tightly closed after use to prevent solvent evaporation and contamination.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [49]
>>
endobj
