/T (Refer to the Material Safety Data Sheet \(MSDS\) for detailed handling instructions. Store the product in a cool, well-ventilated area away from sources of ignition or fire. Use protective equipment such as gloves, safety goggles, and masks during application. Avoid direct contact with eyes and skin; in case of contact, wash immediately with soap and plenty of water. Do not inhale vapours. This product is flammable, and leftover paint or empty containers should be disposed of responsibly through authorized recycling or waste management agencies.)
